* Edit 2: Replace LC input with a series inductor to create a broadband matching network.
C C4 VIN1 n5
L L4 n5 n0  # Series inductor for broadband impedance transformation
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
C C1 n1 n3
PMOS PM1 n2 n3 VDD VDD
L L2 n2 n4
C C2 n4 VSS
C C3 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n6
NMOS NM3 n6 n6 VSS VSS
R R2 n6 n1
PMOS PM2 n7 n7 VDD VDD
R R4 n7 VSS
R R5 n7 n3